industries=['Technology and IT','Software Development','Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning','Data Science and Analytics','Cybersecurity','Cloud Computing and Networking','Human Resources and Recruitment','Finance and Accounting','Banking and Investment','Business and Management','Consulting and Risk Advisory','Sales and Business Development','Marketing and Advertising','Healthcare and Medicine','Nursing and Pharmacy','Engineering and Architecture','Education and Research','Legal and Compliance','Operations and Administration','Supply Chain and Logistics','Customer Service and Customer Success','Design and Creative Arts','Media and Entertainment','Hospitality and Tourism','Retail and E-commerce','Manufacturing and Production','Construction and Real Estate','Government and Public Administration','Science and Biotechnology','Agriculture and Environmental Sciences','Transportation and Aviation','Insurance','Telecommunications','Nonprofit and Social Services','Other professional and emerging industries']
